TI  - Public Space Users' Soundscape Evaluations in Relation to Their Activities. An Amsterdam-Based Study
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PSYCHOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - soundscape evaluation
KW  - activity
KW  - public space
KW  - familiarity
KW  - expectation
KW  - affordance
