TI  - Revealing nonlinear morphology-noise relationships: A multi-scale analysis using vector units in high-density cities
T2  - BUILDING AND ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Urban morphology
KW  - Acoustic environment
KW  - Environmental health
KW  - Urban design
KW  - High-density cities
