TI  - Does the sound environment influence the behaviour of zoo-housed birds? A preliminary investigation of ten species across two zoos
T2  - BEHAVIOURAL PROCESSES
LA  - English
KW  - Zoo sound
KW  - Visitor effect
KW  - Animal behaviour
KW  - Welfare
KW  - Soundscape
