TI  - Humpback whales Megaptera novaeangliae alter calling behavior in response to natural sounds and vessel noise
T2  - MARINE ECOLOGY PROGRESS SERIES
LA  - English
KW  - Humpback whale calls
KW  - Vessel noise
KW  - Anthropogenic noise
