TI  - Less parking, more life? Promises and challenges of urban parking-space repurposing. Evidence from a controlled before-after quasi-experimental study in Berlin
T2  - TRANSPORTATION RESEARCH PART A-POLICY AND PRACTICE
LA  - English
KW  - Parking-space reduction
KW  - Car use reduction
KW  - Transport intervention
KW  - Urban transition experiment
