TI  - Study protocol of the European Urban Burden of Disease Project: a health impact assessment study
T2  - BMJ OPEN
LA  - English
KW  - public health
KW  - epidemiology
KW  - health policy
KW  - ALL-CAUSE MORTALITY
KW  - ROAD TRAFFIC NOISE
