TI  - One Ring to Contain Them all: The Pivotal Role of the Built Environment in all Pillars of Lifestyle Medicine
T2  - AMERICAN JOURNAL OF LIFESTYLE MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - Wellness
KW  - healthy living
KW  - population health
KW  - public health
