TI  - Proximity of public elementary schools to major roads in Canadian urban areas
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF HEALTH GEOGRAPHICS
LA  - English
KW  - CHILDREN ATTENDING SCHOOLS
KW  - LAND-USE REGRESSION
KW  - AIR-POLLUTION
