TI  - Poke, gape, or escape? Diurnal anthropogenic noise disrupts Eastern Bluebird (Sialia sialis) incubation and nest attendance behavior
T2  - JOURNAL OF FIELD ORNITHOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - anthropogenic noise
KW  - Eastern Bluebird (Sialia sialis)
