TI  - Traffic noise leads to cardiac stress reactions in two urban-tolerant Trichonephila spiders, but in different ways
T2  - PHYSIOLOGICAL ENTOMOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - anthropogenic noise
KW  - cardiac reaction
