TI  - Using city-wide mobile noise assessments to estimate bicycle trip annual exposure to Black Carbon
T2  - ENVIRONMENT INTERNATIONAL
LA  - English
KW  - Black Carbon
KW  - Vehicle noise
KW  - Personal exposure
KW  - Cyclists
KW  - Traffic
KW  - Active mobility
KW  - AIR-POLLUTION
KW  - PARTICLES
KW  - ULTRAFINE
KW  - QUALITY
KW  - PREDICT
