TI  - From Awareness to Action: Gamified Mobility Assessment for Sustainable Urban Transport in Osnabrück
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
LA  - English
KW  - gamification
KW  - routing
KW  - environmental assessment
KW  - sensor monitoring
