TI  - Individual-based measurements of light intensity provide new insights into the effects of artificial light at night on daily rhythms of urban-dwelling songbirds
T2  - JOURNAL OF ANIMAL ECOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - temporal niche
KW  - radiotelemetry
