TI  - Detection of Emerging through-Wall Cracks for Pipe Break Early Warning in Water Distribution Systems Using Permanent Acoustic Monitoring and Acoustic Wave Analysis
T2  - WATER RESOURCES MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - Accelerometer
KW  - Leak detection
KW  - Leak-before-break
KW  - Pipe break
KW  - Smart water network
KW  - SMART WATER
