TI  - Spectral noise reduction of double-layer porous asphalt: From laboratory to field
T2  - CONSTRUCTION AND BUILDING MATERIALS
LA  - English
KW  - Double-layer porous asphalt
KW  - Spectral noise
KW  - Interior noise
KW  - Noise reduction
KW  - Sound absorption
KW  - Surface condition
KW  - PAVEMENT
