TI  - Optimized random pursuit strategy for enhancing predictability of on-board atomic clocks
T2  - GPS SOLUTIONS
LA  - English
KW  - On-board atomic clock
KW  - Frequency prediction
KW  - Correlation matrix
KW  - Minimum uncertainty
KW  - SIGNAL INTEGRITY
