TI  - A cognitive framework for the categorisation of auditory objects in urban soundscapes
T2  - APPLIED ACOUSTICS
LA  - English
KW  - Soundscapes
KW  - Auditory objects
KW  - Categorisation
KW  - Everyday sounds
KW  - SIMILARITY
