TI  - Habitat-related birdsong divergence: a multi-level study on the influence of territory density and ambient noise in European blackbirds
T2  - BEHAVIORAL ECOLOGY AND SOCIOBIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Habitat-related song divergence
KW  - Acoustic variation
KW  - Anthropogenic noise
