TI  - The joy of live-streaming shopping that customers regret: the effect of social presence on rumination
T2  - ASIA-PACIFIC JOURNAL OF BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION
LA  - English
KW  - Impulsive buying behavior
KW  - Live-streaming shopping
KW  - Rumination
KW  - Social presence
