TI  - Parents' Perceptions of Their Children's Engagement in a Consumer-Based Meditation Mobile App: Cross-Sectional Survey Study
T2  - JMIR PEDIATRICS AND PARENTING
LA  - English
KW  - mindfulness
KW  - meditation
KW  - children
KW  - mental health
